      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>apiVersion</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the API group and version of the <code>IngressClassParams</code> resource.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>metadata.name</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the <code>IngressClassParams</code> resource name.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>spec.group.name</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the <code>IngressGroup</code> resource name. All of the <code>Ingress</code> resources of this class belong to this <code>IngressGroup</code>.</p></dd>
      </dl>
      </li>
      <li>
      Create the <code>IngressClassParams</code> resource by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc create -f sample-single-lb-params.yaml"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Create the <code>IngressClass</code> resource YAML file, for example, <code>sample-single-lb-class.yaml</code>, as follows:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: IngressClass\nmetadata:\n  name: single-lb\nspec:\n  controller: ingress.k8s.aws/alb\n  parameters:\n    apiGroup: elbv2.k8s.aws\n    kind: IngressClassParams\n    name: single-lb-params"} lang="yaml" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>apiVersion</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the API group and version of the <code>IngressClass</code> resource.</p></dd>
