      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the controller name. The <code>ingress.k8s.aws/alb</code> value denotes that all ingress resources of this class should be managed by the AWS Load Balancer Controller.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>parameters.apiGroup</code></dt>
